<title>INDONESIA: Asia Kapitalindo Securities launches mutual fund.</title>
<headline>Asia Kapitalindo Securities launches mutual fund.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's PT Asia Kapitalindo Securities said on Wednesday it had launched a one trillion rupiah open-end mutual fund.</p>
<p>The firm said in a statement the fund, expected to yield returns of between 18 and 21 percent per year, will be invested in fixed income securities.</p>
<p>It said the public offering started on November 8.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
